<view class="page"><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}</view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">连接电脑后端</text><input placeholder="http://192.168.1.10:8000" value="{{url}}" bindinput="input"/><text class="muted">填写运行后端的电脑局域网地址。地址会保存在本机；手机和电脑需处于同一网络。127.0.0.1 仅适用于电脑开发者工具。</text><button bindtap="connect" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存并测试连接</button><text class="badge" wx:if="{{connected}}">连接正常</text></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">账单导出</text><text class="muted">Excel 包含账单、校正日志和导出时间。选择部分记录请进入账单筛选页。</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="export" disabled="{{busy}}">导出全部账单 Excel</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="exportCsv" disabled="{{busy}}">导出全部账单 CSV</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="bills">筛选后导出</button></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">完整备份</text><text class="muted">备份包括数据库、原图、处理图、缩略图和校验清单，生成后先校验再下载。</text><button bindtap="backup" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">创建并校验完整备份</button><view class="muted" wx:if="{{backup}}">{{backup.filename}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{backup}}" bindtap="downloadBackup" disabled="{{busy}}">下载此备份到手机</button></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{localFile}}"><text class="section-title">最近下载文件</text><text class="muted">{{lastName}}</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="share" disabled="{{busy}}">打开文件菜单，手动保存</button></view><view class="card"><text class="section-title">恢复数据</text><text class="muted">恢复会替换整套数据，请在电脑上关闭后端后运行 scripts/restore.py 校验；确认后加 --apply 执行。恢复前会自动备份现有数据。</text></view><view class="notice">本地开发版不要求网页工作台。小程序公开发布仍需微信 AppID 与符合平台要求的网络配置；当前局域网模式用于本地开发与调试。</view></view>
